{"id":"2ec77cb354c6de1a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-prop-tree.md","title":"Tree Properties","display":"prop-tree — Tree Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-tree","aliases":["58-prop-tree"],"display":"prop-tree — Tree Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-branch.md]]","[[58-df-order-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-tree — Tree Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"686ef3328616b54f\" href=\"?note=686ef3328616b54f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-branch.md\">../batch09/58-df-branch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,R)\">\\((T,R)\\)</span> (tree with reflexive order relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> (maximal branch, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"686ef3328616b54f\" href=\"?note=686ef3328616b54f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-branch.md\">../batch09/58-df-branch.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:s\\neq t\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\}\">\\(P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:s\\neq t\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\}\\)</span> (strict predecessor set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Branch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Branch}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> (branch and order-type predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tree}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,R)\\to\n\\forall s,t\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,P_s,\n\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_s^2:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,P_t,\n\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_t^2:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\n\\to s=t\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tree}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,R)\\to\n\\forall s,t\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,P_s,\n\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_s^2:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,P_t,\n\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_t^2:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\n\\to s=t\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A branch is a maximal chain, so it meets each order-type level in at most one node; order types are expressed through the registered predicate rather than an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> function.</li>\n<li>It need not meet every level unless an additional cofinality condition is assumed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-branch.md","status":"resolved","id":"686ef3328616b54f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-branch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order-type","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,R)$ (tree with reflexive order relation, see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-branch.md","status":"resolved","id":"686ef3328616b54f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b$ (maximal branch, see [[../batch09/58-df-branch.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T,R)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:s\\neq t\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Branch}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tree}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,R)\\to\n\\forall s,t\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,P_s,\n\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_s^2:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,P_t,\n\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P_t^2:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\}\\right)\n\\to s=t\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false}],"bytes":1355,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4005","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-prop-tree.md|58-prop-tree]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["f06e57c5c0b1354d","686ef3328616b54f","5d2cd56a38a81b7a"]}